        <item>
            <title>1.0.14</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — thanks for testing.
</p>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li>The Speakers page shows the song and artist at the top, with a clearer "Playing on" divider above the speaker list.</li>
<li>Click anywhere on the room name box to switch rooms.</li>
<li>More breathing room on the left side of Apple Music.</li>
<li>Clicking the menu bar icon while the window is open now closes it.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>The window no longer gets cut off when music is already playing as your HomePods finish loading.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
