        <item>
            <title>1.0.12</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — thanks for testing.
</p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Open Apple Music from the menu bar icon.</strong> Turn it on in Settings → Menu Bar. The first time, it opens with just the controls; use the sidebar button to show the music. It remembers how you left it, including whether you had it in its own window.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li>The Apple Music sidebar button now has a small music note, so it's easier to tell what it does.</li>
<li>The ⌘1–⌘9 room numbers (hold ⌘ in the room menu) are easier to see in light mode.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
